{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e5b4ebab726af50588b364cb9f4883ddbbbfd3fa1d0a2039dce122a7161f23e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f735643448c6861b5486d8556ebd7eb6ff886bd017c90e5affd783c4e5d3922",
      "text": "用料理克服讨厌的蔬菜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88ac8890e07c04e61e393cffe23d70d3c6afcff77c31abf7dbc02cb2017b4c51",
      "text": "某个休息日，制作人被诚司叫了出来。诚司希望能借用事务所的厨房，做一些能帮天音克服挑食蔬菜的料理。他还拜托制作人帮忙试吃……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f735643448c6861b5486d8556ebd7eb6ff886bd017c90e5affd783c4e5d3922",
      "text": "用料理克服讨厌的蔬菜？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:807174a4434a7b6ad65b08c4e7a421dc636c2f055694d6a31f001d7032bf8aeb",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー。\n明明是休息日，还把你叫到事务所来，实在抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b36fa0a95242e39cf3337254b188ae1ba3653da65d307968a96e5b4f0477f22f",
      "text": "没关系的，不用在意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7209af5418eebda407b5a597867b36a7d17f62e031bf5a989bfe8646d17231cf",
      "text": "（严肃的表情……而且，信玄先生的\n氛围跟平时不太一样……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:626ab7da56a30d89977b526aae1760290adec5522b2c18bd9d4850df1cb37e93",
      "text": "（难道说是工作上出了什么事吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ffe3f8c5038a0b49b5f0b4dc598f52820e0c8a6ad82362b86aaef2a61b677d7",
      "text": "能听你这么说真是帮了大忙。\n……其实我有事想郑重拜托制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:086a8bada3aea6cdcb50b7aa6dd2ccb83ca87624bec58536c08110b45c3bd714",
      "text": "是一件私事。\n我也纠结过该不该拜托你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32fcef2ec003c0b6c7e2ebcd398bea1e40fc21d8a416ddbeec8a53850dc363b5",
      "text": "唯独这件事需要借助他人之力。\n可以拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba0938f4c57a8e4c824282992be77f4098cba52d4ad6204cf3d64b236b17268d",
      "text": "明白了。\n只要是我力所能及的事，我什么都愿意做！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:459e5d8d1bd889042d9717f7b4e1bfabebee1b89cafb0adaba3b3da25463e397",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a7746cba20878925d5f58cf61ca9fee2771fb8fe38b9216b51586edd8a9b702",
      "text": "事不宜迟，我所托之事其实是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47b240eef04d3d13d349b203ac2b512a5db410465379ec82cd9d80291962a936",
      "text": "其实……天音找我商量，说想克服挑食、把讨厌的蔬菜吃下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:668a0cfacf06d85f617421c86728a3dd3cfa5a52cf3250a90b9e9c5c3f15a3b6",
      "text": "我想研究一下能让人不勉强吃下去的料理。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1547bb4e4251943738634b1b42d52079aea1b7a4db61131e09d05af3d9e2c77e",
      "text": "想请●●●●プロデューサー\n帮忙试吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f8322f86a42315b17210a3b6a7531ebc9e16460e6f2fd08df2d932a65b7946",
      "text": "食材已经买好了。\n可以拜托你吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5715ca0bbed54dd2df8077c6e652cffb584a0cdfc43302e6bd656c06b0c16e3",
      "text": "原来是这么回事啊！当然可以了。\n事不宜迟，我们去厨房吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000045:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd619d389b02effd9f66bbba55ae4453a852918aec2d643bf220135df9b3cf48",
      "text": "事务所·厨房",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c36b688a0207261392818b884f14e1eae9c7ee0b78711ebf09590fe0232fab8",
      "text": "难得的休息日实在抱歉。拜托你试吃还大老远让你去我家的话，总觉得太失礼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83abb75e70d68e1e9cb972fccff9ba549b5ae973387014aa930a0d209aa16219",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー能答应，真是太感谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:530ad9060d04417b048612db3a2b6ab61a63ccc1b546753d1e7d72b897a77eed",
      "text": "我也找过英雄和龙，\n但他们今天抽不出空，正发愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b49cf81bec906cda3184fe34d838c029aa672991710213d94433337d3c173547",
      "text": "能吃到诚司先生亲手做的料理，这可是我的福气呢！\n谢谢您来找我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88b2e21d4001f77c416787b9565576e1086aa8a514d510cdd73e22f5397e401a",
      "text": "哈哈，你真会说话。\n这下我可要好好露一手了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63771a98ab2f095104a6a05f847c5020987e97b3feb7c18454b7cd81aa0568f0",
      "text": "诚司先生真的很疼爱天音小姐呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00296426771fae5af077771fada3a608fc0c8db98438681f466e2c28a283234a",
      "text": "是啊。在我受了伤跌入低谷的时候，\n正是多亏了妹妹夫妇和天音的存在，我才得救了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eccd2eb96ace56057035dd5a865e956f7ee2b53cd6ae1021e63fa8faaa7b806e",
      "text": "特别是天音跟我很亲近。\n前阵子她还把和朋友一起折的纸送给了我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:808d1edf97ad356c0a8fc40d0d2ab0d75697bdb4959f203e28962a7aebd6f088",
      "text": "好像是叫“平时一直很努力奖”的奖牌。\n她还亲自挂在了我的脖子上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:314b265571f044654d87ce79c8e36a3448b0bc4337a057bdb5cc26332e16dbf8",
      "text": "抱歉……我话太多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f9081df3549cc7411f838764f61885d74fbb61e77698291cda0efa53e8d112",
      "text": "这段故事让人深刻体会到了诚司先生珍爱天音小姐的心意，非常动人哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de2b386cf8232525b180f01c6ddb976382ffdf73428e1ddffa2d592989c21d14",
      "text": "希望她能一直这样健康、无拘无束地\n成长呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:478233ac4b129db855e54d2b28d6e7a689a3794a31bc00d55fdff2aa29ef2f30",
      "text": "啊啊，我只希望天音能健康成长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a97c4c6b77a81c6c29767198ecf4835873d09b2ed8cd2bb3642ee32ed3d53d5",
      "text": "为此，我也希望她能尽量不挑食，什么东西都能吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000074:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20f76422cb34cdd6037bf7ac8e9438b8f7ecda6f677e6c57036699e093cc5713",
      "text": "……好，摆盘完成了。\n我端出来。试吃就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adccf2e7a9d6877929d428cd50978c115e1c86ba75b63f3fad0ebed9ebade248",
      "text": "事务所·休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cca2795b8d1d8bb7103e9647f3971f2e9717f2eec71c074f7024e827fe611f68",
      "text": "我做成了儿童套餐的样子。汉堡肉配\n海鲜焗饭，还有松软鸡蛋的蛋包饭。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4a479fd349c43b351e04adc5aff3b6a499974535393d80b8f9e3651b1423f6e",
      "text": "每一样看起来都好好吃啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:044658eb6f39eb2098db0543e26bc75cafec66d172da7d56b7ca0bee3f9a28c5",
      "text": "每一道料理里都混入了切得很碎的青椒和胡萝卜。\n来，尝尝看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c87c061ec9b5c2359d270e7d375e9be99859d57fabec256b77b72dc9d2a4daa2",
      "text": "那么，我开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e19c5742e65abf273a450a6c326b16ede9f20dbfda3ee93730ac0ab95da200ee",
      "text": "……味道如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed6722565611bede352eb7c1e8c1c39aee6b9e8143824196dfcd4d908e51bc3",
      "text": "非常美味！如果不说是放了青椒和胡萝卜，\n根本就吃不出来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d820b62c2cd49605279885fa6ab37a43e73dbd351bc13787be71f45f6bde44cc",
      "text": "是吗……！\n那太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c5d37ad1f8e807044c44b1b3a5e26c06ea09eff206f68e9f9d6e3df40cfde73",
      "text": "这样一来，要是天音能克服讨厌的蔬菜就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b44c4c7180e11981521d426b58924d3666eddf1c919654ac7570b5c9e7052e07",
      "text": "请对自己有信心。\n诚司先生也尝尝就知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd8f81f95f20d5ef665b71349459b81b817f3442b35dd9fa8880cc831a0703b",
      "text": "不、不用了，我就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000010:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d06324a41ef39e9a48b0bdcfc8c5d384c19fdee39958e05a2f51af48b412cb4f",
      "text": "诚司先生？\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c783d6f4ea8e47ac4516f0afd44e87713a245eae4edec29811ac82b22b031611",
      "text": "那个，其实……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a05a95622b24252f6d0875554f51faf8eb1ce340ee27f2cac7b208604a5b3b80",
      "text": "……虽然我对天音说不要挑食，\n但其实我自己也不喜欢吃青椒……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4c59d9724a7e869516d8c8d03ef2daff270730ad471a2dddeb14e482c739a49",
      "text": "呵呵，原来是这样啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c68454f980a68e0c8a2e443bb4a31e5d97d7fedd0f382d2fef23832312c4432",
      "text": "是啊。所以我才没法自己尝味道，\n才拜托了●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83e03c8b46725ddcc764f4073dc903efcd81f7070884f2a8e585d03628401e75",
      "text": "我不会勉强您的。只吃一小口怎么样呢？\n诚司先生也给自己准备了一点对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96386d4a68e349ece2f09d7d6c693bbc6842e50b9722c628b3fcca0bc8e06b68",
      "text": "不正是因为您也想尝试一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd2440b25b35c54a14fa7bc6a3761282e9163d83abc877a0475efb6f1db2ca62",
      "text": "还是瞒不过制作人啊。说的也是。\n凡事不去挑战是不行的啊。我开动了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:002df2b9a065a3df5af75d511ccee9c001fab30c260e113c6cd7416cb7093f4c",
      "text": "嗯？这个……确实没有青椒的味道呢。\n完全没问题。碎末作战成功了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5002baf528e370227fa5499919190726282c42ce090d6f29f8c42ef5733840d0",
      "text": "借此机会，我也和天音一起\n把青椒克服掉吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_01_1_2_016_01:1_2_016_01_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c42e652b77bac5783f9d11efed5a6d39a46fff75ef73b4d32ccdd2ca37f53d83",
      "text": "那可太好了呢。\n两个人一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
